Error [jet.ArgumentCountMismatch]: `keep_open` expects 1 or 2 arguments, got 0
  --> tests/ui/process_keep_open_arity.jet:4:30
    |
  4 |     _: process.cmd(["true"]).keep_open()
    |                              ^^^^^^^^^
 Why: `keep_open(handle)` keeps the handle at its own descriptor number; `keep_open(handle, at: slot)` keeps it at `slot`
 Fix: Pass the handle, then optionally `at:` and a descriptor slot
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0104
